1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Vents on full blast
and it's still not cold?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Your car has two air filters,
and only one ever gets blamed.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
The engine filter protects the engine.
That one's not your problem.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The cabin filter cleans the air in your vents —
and this one's usually caked.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A clogged filter chokes the airflow,
so even good AC feels weak.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
It's often a ten-minute swap,
commonly right behind the glovebox.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before
you blame the AC system.
